<title>UK: British economy to grow 3.25 pct this year - Brown.</title>
<headline>British economy to grow 3.25 pct this year - Brown.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British finance minister Gordon Brown on Wednesday said the economy would grow 3.25 percent this year and 2.5 percent in 1998.</p>
<p>Announcing a budget which he said would tighten fiscal policy, Brown said inflation in 1997 would be 2.5 percent, rising to 2.75 percent in 1998.</p>
</text>
